This directory vendors JobSpy (https://github.com/speedyapply/JobSpy), version 1.1.82,
by Cullen Watson and contributors, distributed under the MIT License (see LICENSE in
this directory).

The vendored copy is modified: it adds a Seek (seek.com.au) scraper, reports each
posting's apply type (`apply_type`), scopes LinkedIn results by country, and handles
"City, State, Country" locations for Seek.
